      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: remarks.Array.size
      value: 48
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[0]'
      value: '[Tip] Explore thoroughly! Much is hidden in places where magic dwells.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[1]'
      value: '[Tip] A miner is a valuable ally to have in the Mystic Valley, as is
        an engineer.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[2]'
      value: '[Tip] Try bringing an artifact detector.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[3]'
      value: '[Tip] A shield provides supplemental protection to its wielder''s body
        and arms in combat.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[4]'
      value: '[Tip] A restaurant in Mystic Valley was awarded two stars by Space
        Michelin.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[5]'
      value: '[Tip] The Valley''s settlements are replete with food. It''s worth
        stocking up for any potential long journeys through less hospitable places.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[6]'
      value: '[Tip] Conserve your ammunition. It''s a long way to the top.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[7]'
      value: '[Tip] The Abyss is a place to be avoided... by most. It''s not necessary
        for the heroes to enter it to fulfill the Prophecy.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[8]'
      value: '[Tip] There are several libraries in the land. Some are hidden.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[9]'
      value: '[Tip] Many paths and routes weave throughout the Valley, connecting
        its locations in sometimes surprising ways.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[10]'
      value: '[Tip] Don''t fight Terminators unless you''re cornered. Try to avoid
        them.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[11]'
      value: '[Tip] Hell must be traversed for Evil to be defeated and the Prophecy
        fulfilled.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[12]'
      value: '[Tip] The Tower must be scaled for Trickery to be overcome and the
        Prophecy fulfilled.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[13]'
      value: '[Tip] Many melee weapons found in the Valley can be inspected to see
        their damage and whether they are effective 2H or thrown weapons.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[14]'
      value: '[Tip] Radio communication is important. It can be necessary to split
        up and cooperate to defeat a challenge.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[15]'
      value: '[Tip] You will need protection against the vacuum of space to succeed
        in your quest.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[16]'
      value: '[Tip] Search the crashed ship.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[17]'
      value: '[Tip] Curious findings may await those who explore the planetoid via
        shuttle. It is located at -4200, -69.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[18]'
      value: '[Tip] The Tower''s power station only energizes its lower floors. The
        upper floors and certain key systems throughout have their own power sources.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[19]'
      value: '[Tip] Four tasks stand in the way of fulfilling the Prophecy: Brave
        the fire. Awaken the edifice. Breach the defenses. Reach the top.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[20]'
      value: '[Tip] Sneaking into forbidden places might be of particular interest
        to evildoers...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[21]'
      value: '[Tip] Try shipping distinctive items from Mystic Valley to Central
        Command via the Cargo Shuttle.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[22]'
      value: '[Tip] The black robes in Evil Castle protect the wearer completely
        from fire.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[23]'
      value: '[Tip] Ernesto''s favorite place in the Valley is the bench next to
        the hot dog cart.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[24]'
      value: '[Tip] It is possible for adventurers from the station to fulfill The
        Prophecy before first setting foot upon the grass of the Valley.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[25]'
      value: '[Tip] Some automated defenses may hold their fire against one holding
        the proper clearance.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[26]'
      value: '[Achievement] Naked Challenge: Win by starting from the Gateway naked,
        bringing no items from the Station except your starting bag & emergency O2
        box'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[27]'
      value: '[Achievement] Planecide: Depressurize the overworld without using an
        explosive'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[28]'
      value: '[Achievement] Prophecy: Find the Good Wizard''s Sanctuary'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[29]'
      value: '[Achievement] Long Live the King: Become the King of Mystic Valley'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[30]'
      value: '[Achievement] Prophetic Talisman: Alter Fate using a special Treasure'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[31]'
      value: '[Achievement] Loremaster: Find a trove of knowledge that holds the
        Valley''s ultimate secret'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[32]'
      value: '[Achievement] Ice Landing: Win by arriving at the snowfield by shuttle
        (preferably not like that other guy) and proceeding directly into the Tower'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[33]'
      value: '[Achievement] Defender Downfall: As a non-antagonist, find a covert
        route into the Tower''s command center and neutralize an antagonist who threatens
        the party'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[34]'
      value: '[Achievement (Antagonist)] Tower Commander: Enter the Tower in a covert
        manner and use its command center to destroy the explorers who seek to conquer
        it'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[35]'
      value: '[Achievement (Antagonist)] Aloha Snackbar: Bomb the Good Wizard''s
        Sanctuary during the Ceremony of Crowning'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[36]'
      value: '[Glossary] Abyss - An anomalous place of warped darkness where souls
        become lost'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[37]'
      value: '[Glossary] Adventurer - Lives in the house in the northwest. Possesses
        lore and other secrets'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[38]'
      value: '[Glossary] Giant - Lives in a cave in the snowfield. Likes rocks'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[39]'
      value: '[Glossary] Good Wizard''s Sanctuary - Your quest''s ultimate destination--Fulfilling
        the Prophecy will reveal it.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[40]'
      value: '[Glossary] Greatest Treasure in the Land - The key to winning the crown'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[41]'
      value: '[Glossary] Hell - Where bad people go when they die and which our heroes
        must pass through to fulfill their destiny'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[42]'
      value: '[Glossary] M.O.R.O.N. - The Modular Offworld Reconaissance & Observation
        Nexus, Nanotrasen''s state-of-the-art manned long-term deployment probe for
        analysis of unusual cosmic bodies'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[43]'
      value: '[Glossary] Prophecy - The omen of the appearance of the Good Wizard''s
        Sanctuary and the crowing of a King'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[44]'
      value: '[Glossary] Temple of Light - A sacred place of healing and safety,
        and home to the realm''s collected knowledge and hidden wisdom'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[45]'
      value: '[Glossary] The Good Wizard - A mysterious protector and guide who revealed
        the Prophecy'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[46]'
      value: '[Glossary] The Great Evil - Evil Castle, its denizens, and the power
        of Hell below'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7046694432102436986, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'remarks.Array.data[47]'
      value: '[Glossary] The Great Trickery - The Tower of Trickery and its mysterious
        controllers'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 8332fa075a02a824eaf1162a1650b259, type: 3}
